{
    "title": "\u0645\u0627\u0645\u0627\u0646\u0627 | \u0628\u0627\u0631\u062f\u0627\u0631\u06cc \u0647\u0641\u062a\u0647 \u0628\u0647 \u0647\u0641\u062a\u0647",
    "description": "Mamana is an application in the field of women, pregnancy and child rearing that tries\r\nProvide useful and practical information and tools for pregnancy and child rearing to mothers and fathers\r\n\r\nCurrently, Mamana has the following features:\r\n\r\nPregnancy information week by week:\r\nOn the main page of moms, you can see exactly how many days you are pregnant, how many weeks and how many days have passed since your pregnancy, and how many weeks you are pregnant, also according to the week you are in, you can get accurate and useful information about the condition of the fetus, the condition Your own body, cares, tests and ultrasounds, food supplements and recommendations for mothers and fathers will be available to you (the first 20 weeks of all the contents of Mama are free, but to access the information from weeks 20 to 40, you need to subscribe)\r\nBaby information month by month:\r\nUsing Momana app, you can have access to all the important and necessary information that a parent needs to know, including care, vaccination and screening, during the period of infancy (from birth to one year old) on a monthly basis. , supplements and vitamins, nutrition, weight, head circumference, baby development, breastfeeding tips, baby sleep and bathing, and possible accidents and incidents (the first month of a baby is free and you need to subscribe to access the rest of the months)\r\n\r\nTools :\r\n\r\nrecord now\r\nJournal,\r\nsounds,\r\nultrasounds,\r\nExperiments,\r\nscreenings,\r\nStages of fetal development\r\nPrediction of baby's eye color\r\nchoose a name\r\nSesame's Checklist\r\nhospital bag checklist\r\nvaccines,\r\nstore and\r\nMoms group\r\nTrekker period\r\nBaby and child skill checklist\r\nGames and activities suitable for babies and children\r\n\r\nSounds:\r\nIn this section, a number of soothing sounds have been collected for babies to sleep more comfortably, which can help your little one sleep better after pregnancy. Don't forget to put it in airplane mode while using this section and placing your phone near your baby.\r\nRegister now:\r\nIn the recording section, you can record your feelings daily during pregnancy by choosing an emoji along with a short note, and at the end of this period, you can access the history of all the feelings and notes you had during this difficult but sweet time. do!\r\nJournal :\r\nIn the section of the magazine, materials with categories before pregnancy, pregnancy and after pregnancy have been prepared and produced, the reading of which can provide you with useful information. These materials will increase over time.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Mamana is an application in the field of women, pregnancy and child rearing that tries<br>Provide useful and practical information and tools for pregnancy and child rearing to mothers and fathers<br><br>Currently, Mamana has the following features:<br><br>Pregnancy information week by week:<br>On the main page of moms, you can see exactly how many days you are pregnant, how many weeks and how many days have passed since your pregnancy, and how many weeks you are pregnant, also according to the week you are in, you can get accurate and useful information about the condition of the fetus, the condition Your own body, cares, tests and ultrasounds, food supplements and recommendations for mothers and fathers will be available to you (the first 20 weeks of all the contents of Mama are free, but to access the information from weeks 20 to 40, you need to subscribe)<br>Baby information month by month:<br>Using Momana app, you can have access to all the important and necessary information that a parent needs to know, including care, vaccination and screening, during the period of infancy (from birth to one year old) on a monthly basis. , supplements and vitamins, nutrition, weight, head circumference, baby development, breastfeeding tips, baby sleep and bathing, and possible accidents and incidents (the first month of a baby is free and you need to subscribe to access the rest of the months)<br><br>Tools :<br><br>record now<br>Journal,<br>sounds,<br>ultrasounds,<br>Experiments,<br>screenings,<br>Stages of fetal development<br>Prediction of baby&#39;s eye color<br>choose a name<br>Sesame&#39;s Checklist<br>hospital bag checklist<br>vaccines,<br>store and<br>Moms group<br>Trekker period<br>Baby and child skill checklist<br>Games and activities suitable for babies and children<br><br>Sounds:<br>In this section, a number of soothing sounds have been collected for babies to sleep more comfortably, which can help your little one sleep better after pregnancy. Don&#39;t forget to put it in airplane mode while using this section and placing your phone near your baby.<br>Register now:<br>In the recording section, you can record your feelings daily during pregnancy by choosing an emoji along with a short note, and at the end of this period, you can access the history of all the feelings and notes you had during this difficult but sweet time. do!<br>Journal :<br>In the section of the magazine, materials with categories before pregnancy, pregnancy and after pregnancy have been prepared and produced, the reading of which can provide you with useful information. These materials will increase over time.",
